<title>USA: Janesville, Wis., won by Firstar Bank.</title>
<headline>Janesville, Wis., won by Firstar Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstar Bank said it won $2.900 million of Janesville, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 4.84 percent.</p>
</text>
